// A vibe projecting to a medium this language does not define.
//
// SURFACE_AS was an unenumerated identifier until the medium axis closed
// it: any word passed, so the field was a comment rather than a contract.
// The medium set is closed for the same reason the verb set is -- a
// coverage matrix over media is only finite and checkable if the media
// are enumerated.
//
// Expected: UNKNOWN_MEDIUM, and nothing else.

DEFINE VIBE operator_holodeck (
  SURFACE_AS holodeck,
  MOTION none
)
